<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed} from 'vue'
import {vRememberDisclosure} from './rememberDisclosure'
import type {DistributionMethod,SharedDistribution} from './v6SharedTypes'
const props=defineProps<{value?:SharedDistribution|null;method?:DistributionMethod|null;legacy?:boolean}>()
const ready=computed(()=>props.value?.status==='reference')
const fmt=(v:number|null|undefined,d=0)=>v==null?'—':v.toLocaleString('zh-TW',{maximumFractionDigits:d,minimumFractionDigits:d})
const plot=computed(()=>{const d=props.value;if(!ready.value||!d?.intervals?.length||!d.anchor)return null;const lo=Math.min(...d.intervals.map(x=>x.low_level),d.anchor),hi=Math.max(...d.intervals.map(x=>x.high_level),d.anchor);const pad=Math.max((hi-lo)*.08,1);return {x:(v:number)=>112+(v-lo+pad)/(hi-lo+2*pad)*480,anchor:d.anchor,median:d.median_level||d.anchor}})
const validation=computed(()=>props.value?.validation||props.method?.validation)
</script>
<template>
 <section class="shared-distribution" aria-label="共用三日收盤分布">
  <header><div><span class="eyebrow">SHARED THREE-DAY DISTRIBUTION</span><h3>共用三日收盤分布</h3><p>兩策略共用歷史比例；各自風險分數不再調整漲平跌機率。</p></div><b class="method-tag">T1 歷史基準</b></header>
  <div v-if="!ready" class="waiting" role="status"><b>{{method?.status==='unavailable'?'共用分布方法暫不可用':legacy?'新方法已就緒，這份紀錄仍是舊版':'等待對話更新 V6 保存新分布'}}</b><p>{{value?.note||(method?.status==='unavailable'?method.note:null)||(legacy?'這份快照未保存新方法的機率。下方舊版劇本仍保留，沒有回填成新預報。':'頁面只讀取已保存的結果，不會自行抓資料或產生預報。')}}</p><p>下次在對話要求「更新 V6」時，才會查核來源並保存共用分布。</p></div>
  <template v-else-if="value">
   <div class="dates"><b>{{value.market_as_of}} 收盤 {{fmt(value.anchor,2)}} 點</b><span>觀察 {{value.forecast_dates?.join(' → ')}}</span><span>實際保存 {{value.issued_at?.slice(0,16).replace('T',' ')}}</span></div>
   <p class="definition">以第3個交易日收盤判斷：上漲超過0.5%、平盤±0.5%（含邊界）、下跌超過0.5%。不是逐日路徑預測。</p>
   <div class="probability-track" role="img" :aria-label="value.classes.map(c=>c.label+' '+fmt(c.probability_pct,1)+'%').join('，')"><span v-for="c in value.classes" :key="c.key" :class="c.key" :style="{width:c.probability_pct+'%'}"></span></div>
   <div class="shared-probabilities"><article v-for="c in value.classes" :key="c.key" :class="c.key"><small>{{c.label}}劇本</small><strong>{{fmt(c.probability_pct,1)}}<em>%</em></strong><p>歷史 {{c.count.toLocaleString()}}／{{value.sample_n?.toLocaleString()}} 筆</p></article></div>
   <figure v-if="plot" class="interval-chart" tabindex="0" aria-label="歷史期末收盤範圍，可左右捲動"><svg viewBox="0 0 720 185" role="img" aria-label="第三日收盤歷史中央50%、80%、95%範圍，沒有逐日路徑"><title>第三日收盤歷史中央範圍</title><line :x1="plot.x(plot.anchor)" :x2="plot.x(plot.anchor)" y1="16" y2="137" class="anchor-line"/><g v-for="(band,i) in value.intervals" :key="band.central_pct"><text x="10" :y="37+i*42" class="band-label">中央{{band.central_pct}}%</text><line :x1="plot.x(band.low_level)" :x2="plot.x(band.high_level)" :y1="32+i*42" :y2="32+i*42" class="band" :class="'band-'+band.central_pct"/><text :x="plot.x(band.low_level)-9" :y="36+i*42" text-anchor="end" class="level">{{fmt(band.low_level)}}</text><text :x="plot.x(band.high_level)+9" :y="36+i*42" class="level">{{fmt(band.high_level)}}</text><circle :cx="plot.x(plot.median)" :cy="32+i*42" r="4" class="median"/></g><text :x="plot.x(plot.anchor)" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="level">起點 {{fmt(value.anchor)}}</text></svg><figcaption>橫線為歷史期末收盤範圍，圓點為期末中位數 {{fmt(value.median_level)}} 點。只描述第3日，不代表中途低點或停損位置。</figcaption></figure>
   <p class="coverage" v-if="validation">中央95%是歷史分布範圍；318日起點回溯的實際涵蓋率為 {{fmt(validation.coverage95_pct,1)}}%，不是保證95%會落在內。</p>
   <p class="timing">{{value.timing_note}} {{value.note}}</p>
   <details v-remember-disclosure="'v6.shared.views'"><summary>三種劇本的條件觀點</summary><section v-for="c in value.classes.filter(c=>c.view)" :key="c.key" class="scenario-view" :class="c.key"><h4>{{c.label}}｜{{c.view!.title}}</h4><p>{{c.view!.reading}}</p><p><b>支持條件：</b>{{c.view!.support}}</p><p><b>減弱條件：</b>{{c.view!.weakening}}</p></section></details>
   <p class="sample">成熟歷史 {{value.sample_first}}～{{value.sample_last}}；結果已知至 {{value.last_outcome}}。僅用起點當時已完成三日的樣本；窗口有重疊。</p>
  </template>
  <details v-if="validation" v-remember-disclosure="'v6.shared.validation'" class="validation"><summary>方法與驗證結果</summary><p>比較研究：{{validation.calibration_n}}日校準、{{validation.test_n}}日共同測試，其中{{validation.event_n}}筆三日內回落至少2%事件。資料截至 {{validation.data_through}}。</p><p>新增分數未通過完整採用規則，收盤保留T1、低點事件保留E1。局部誤差改善約0.11%，未達事前1%門檻，也未勝過歷史基準。</p><p>{{validation.claim}}；歷史比例不是已證明準確的未來機率。{{method?.method_version||value?.method_version}}</p></details>
 </section>
</template>
<style scoped>
